    "description": "What: AQ102 S2 (CE-2355) - on open basic-desert, 'Blue Squad' (Friend, 'Blue 1-5' behind five parked cars at y=360) and 'Red Squad' (Hostile, 'Red 1-5' behind five cars at y=400), ~43 m apart; no orders, the squads' default SOP (all immortal). Judge (120 s): (1) a base of fire holds while others move; (2) at least 70 % of the movers' sampled path is out of every enemy's sight; (3) the moving side ends within 15 m of an enemy flank (an assault) or the other side breaks off. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch rf-car-squads. \ud83d\udcc4 docs/blueprints/Architect_Question_102_Responsive_Fighting_Reflexes.md \u00a75"
